    "make_it":  [
                    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet and cook the diced onion and red bell pepper until they soften.",
                    "Add the ground beef, break it up, and brown it, then drain the grease.",
                    "Stir in the chili powder, cumin, garlic powder, oregano, paprika, salt, red pepper flakes, and black pepper to season the meat.",
                    "Add the black beans, corn, diced zucchini, and tomato sauce and simmer until the zucchini is tender.",
                    "Stir in a little cooked rice to round out the skillet.",
                    "Sprinkle the shredded cheddar over the top and let it melt, then spoon into bowls and serve."
